id: pm-swarm-plan-progress
title: Aggregate revision-bound shared plan progress witnesses
description: Compose core Plan steps and evidence with explicit independent review and orchestrator acceptance witnesses; no branch landing or second task tracker.
type: Feature
pm_format_version: 2
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-23T06:41:20.604Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-23T07:34:13.200Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Changed criteria invalidate acceptance; agent self-report never becomes orchestrator approval; progress is read-only by default; concurrent writers on one non-Git tracker retain correct evidence.
comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T06:41:28.331Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked: core Plan owns ordered steps, owners, evidence, decisions, validation and approval mode. pm-review owns exact-head GitHub review findings and round completion. pm-context assembles context. pm-swarm composes declared parallel-step evidence into a revision-bound view with explicit independent review and orchestrator acceptance; no branch landing or new task tracker. Reuse SDK Plan decoding, item reads and atomic comment mutations. Progress reads must not need Git."
  "2026-10-23T06:47:21.562Z",codex-agent,"Design: PlanProgress reuses one full unbounded SDK item snapshot plus atomic ifAbsent comment appends. Content revisions bind criteria, Plan metadata, linked artifacts and declared production evidence. Worker completion is produced only; independent review plus distinct explicit orchestrator acceptance is required. Reads and witness previews perform no tracker mutations. SDK minimum/dev pin moved to 2026.10.23 because shared concurrent writes require the released mutation lease fencing and queued-writer deadline fixes. Separate-process non-Git regression covers concurrent witnesses and criterion edits."
  "2026-10-23T06:53:15.570Z",codex-agent,"Public read-only validation passed: unbraind/pm-ops at 08febd274c40d2ec31bfe956438449898af1d885; 149 certified items, zero existing Plans; 306 baseline files and 4075113 bytes unchanged. Labeled synthetic overlay: one Plan with three steps; claimed/produced/reviewed/accepted 1/1/1/1, accepted after criterion edit zero; compact JSON 691 bytes, TOON 548 bytes; reads changed history zero times. Operation time 59082 ms on contended host; not a throughput benchmark. Evidence: docs/plan-progress-validation.md and test/progress-corpus.acceptance.ts."
  "2026-10-23T06:58:25.542Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: in an isolated scratch source copy, restored only runCommand to origin/main while retaining new registration and tests. The native CLI non-Git regression failed (exit 1) because progress returned Unknown swarm command. Final implementation passes that regression. Initial linked test run hit its default 120-second command timeout on the contended host; rerun uses an explicit 900-second allowance without changing assertions or gate thresholds."
  "2026-10-23T07:01:14.076Z",codex-agent,"Packed acceptance now installs the required SDK version and runs the new progress workflow through Node and native Bun on a non-Git tracker with no Git executable: produce, review, accept, edit criterion, verify acceptance zero. README and validation example document content-revision and author-attribution boundaries. Local full release gates are intentionally deferred to the unchanged CI npm and Bun gates because the shared host is saturated."
  "2026-10-23T07:01:43.714Z",codex-agent,"Final local validation: linked node --test test/progress.test.ts passed 5/5 with zero failed/skipped/canceled/todo in 106160 ms after explicit timeout adjustment. npm run typecheck and npm run lint passed; docstrings 29 source files and 98 declarations documented; duplication zero percent across 63 sources; strict tracker health passed. Public-copy acceptance passed 1/1. Behavioral revert fails as expected. The unchanged full npm and Bun release gate is CI-owned; final exact-head counts and run URL are recorded in the feature PR. Item remains in progress for orchestrator verification; no merge or release is authorized."
  "2026-10-23T07:02:36.002Z",codex-agent,"SDK upgrade integration: newer pm list --all --json is brief even with unbounded output. Existing changelog scripts refused its omission receipt. Added explicit --pm-arg=--full to all changelog generation/check/notes scripts, retaining certification and existing dependency pins rather than bypassing the incomplete-read guard."
  "2026-10-23T07:06:26.418Z",codex-agent,"Changelog compatibility refinement: pm-changelog pm-arg is global-only, so appending --full there was rejected by the core parser. A small typed executable bridge now appends command-scoped --full only to list --all, forwarding schema reads and exit status unchanged. The existing changelog package still owns completeness certification and Git history. A real-tracker executable regression covers full linked metadata, schema discovery, command failure and signal failure. Follow-up pm-swarm-changelog-full-read tracks removing the adapter after an approved dependency update; no sibling repository was changed."
  "2026-10-23T07:07:36.579Z",codex-agent,"Compatibility bridge validation passed 1/1 through linked pm execution; full linked metadata, schema reads, error exits and signaled readers are verified. Final local total: six focused regressions plus one public-copy acceptance, typecheck/lint passed, 30 source files and 99 declarations documented, zero duplication across 65 sources. Changelog generation and check passed with full original release history. pm-swarm-changelog-full-read remains open as follow-up. Full final-head npm/Bun release gate run and counts will be linked in the PR; implementation item is released for review and remains in progress."
  "2026-10-23T07:16:40.895Z",codex-agent,"First CI run passed both coverage gates but failed packed acceptance. Targeted local reproduction showed the new synthetic Plan remained active between Node and Bun iterations of the existing next-selection scenario, conservatively blocking the next item with an unknown footprint. The fixture now retires its synthetic Plan after verifying criterion invalidation, isolating the two runtime scenarios. No production selection behavior or release threshold was changed; targeted packed rerun and final CI are required."
  "2026-10-23T07:18:54.264Z",codex-agent,"Targeted packed non-Git acceptance passed 1/1 across Node and native Bun in 89182 ms after retiring the synthetic Plan between runtime iterations. Initial CI run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/39915823055 is failed evidence, not approval; both coverage gates had passed and the packed fixture interfered with later next-selection. Only fixture isolation changed. Final-head full npm/Bun CI is required after this follow-up commit."
  "2026-10-23T07:34:11.729Z",codex-agent,"Full npm Node 22, npm Node 26 and Bun release gates passed at 73f872d61863c984070a219525396fbde8756484: each outer suite 261/261, each packed npm/Bun acceptance 3/3, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todo, coverage 100/100/100/100 across all 30 configured source files. Receipt: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/39916953030 . CodeQL passed. PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/pull/19 is ready, and published evidence was verified exactly. Final documentation wording now distinguishes no package-owned GitHub transport from SDK-owned storage I/O; hosted providers remain unvalidated. Final documentation head must retain green CI before handoff."
